{
  "root": {
    "line": 1,
    "text": "定语从句",
    "children": [
      {
        "line": 3,
        "text": "基本概念",
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 4,
            "text": "修饰名词或代词的从句，放在被修饰词之后"
          },
          {
            "line": 5,
            "text": "先行词：被修饰的名词或代词"
          },
          {
            "line": 6,
            "text": "关系词：引导从句并在从句中充当成分"
          },
          {
            "line": 7,
            "text": "例：The boy who is singing is my brother."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "line": 8,
        "text": "关系代词",
        "id": "pronoun",
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 9,
            "text": "who：指人，作主语或宾语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 10,
                "text": "例：The man who helped me is a doctor."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 11,
            "text": "whom：指人，作宾语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 12,
                "text": "例：The girl whom I met is Lily."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 13,
            "text": "whose：指人或物，表所属关系",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 14,
                "text": "例：I have a friend whose father is a pilot."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 15,
            "text": "which：指物，作主语或宾语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 16,
                "text": "例：The book which I bought is good."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 17,
            "text": "that：指人或物，作主语或宾语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 18,
                "text": "例：This is the best film that I have seen."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 19,
            "text": "先行词是不定代词 all、everything、something"
          },
          {
            "line": 20,
            "text": "先行词被最高级修饰"
          },
          {
            "line": 21,
            "text": "先行词被序数词、the only、the very 修饰"
          },
          {
            "line": 24,
            "text": "介词后面"
          },
          {
            "line": 25,
            "text": "非限制性定语从句"
          }
        ],
        "summaries": [
          {
            "from": 5,
            "to": 7,
            "node": {
              "line": 22,
              "text": "只用 that 的情况",
              "children": [
                {
                  "line": 23,
                  "text": "例：Everything that he said is true."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "from": 8,
            "to": 9,
            "node": {
              "line": 26,
              "text": "不能用 that 的情况",
              "children": [
                {
                  "line": 27,
                  "text": "例：This is the room in which he lives."
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "line": 28,
        "text": "关系副词",
        "id": "adverb",
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 29,
            "text": "when：先行词表时间，在从句中作时间状语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 30,
                "text": "例：I remember the day when we met."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 31,
            "text": "where：先行词表地点，在从句中作地点状语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 32,
                "text": "例：This is the school where I studied."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 33,
            "text": "why：先行词是 reason，在从句中作原因状语",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 34,
                "text": "例：Tell me the reason why you were late."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "限制性与非限制性",
        "id": "restrict",
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 36,
            "text": "限制性：与先行词关系紧密，不能去掉，不用逗号",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 37,
                "text": "例：I like the book that you gave me."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 38,
            "text": "非限制性：补充说明，去掉后句意仍完整，用逗号隔开",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 39,
                "text": "例：He lives in Beijing, where he works."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 40,
            "text": "非限制性不用 that，也不用 why"
          },
          {
            "line": 41,
            "text": "which 可以指代整个主句，译为「这一点」",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 42,
                "text": "例：He passed the exam, which surprised us.",
                "color": "red"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "易错点",
        "color": "red",
        "fold": true,
        "children": [
          {
            "line": 44,
            "text": "关系词的选择：看它在从句中充当的成分",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 45,
                "text": "例：This is the house which I bought.",
                "id": "which-obj"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 46,
            "text": "介词加关系代词：介词由从句中的动词或形容词搭配决定",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 47,
                "text": "例：This is the pen with which he writes."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 48,
            "text": "where 与 which 的区别：从句缺主语或宾语用 which，不缺成分用 where",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 49,
                "text": "例：This is the factory where he works."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 50,
            "text": "主谓一致：从句谓语动词与先行词在数上一致",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 51,
                "text": "例：He is one of the students who are good at math."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "line": 52,
            "text": "as 引导定语从句：与 such、the same、so 搭配",
            "children": [
              {
                "line": 53,
                "text": "例：He is such a man as I like."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
